  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "SCSI: Add 32-bit parameter length field for PERSISTENT RESERVE OUT",
  "description": "Summary:\n\nIn PERSISTENT RESERVE OUT CDBs (SPC-4 section 6.14), the Parameter List Length field is 4 bytes. The dissector previously used hf_scsi_paramlen16 with a 4-byte item length, which triggers a type mismatch warning in tools/check_typed_item_calls.py.\n\nChanges:\n\n\\- Added hf_scsi_paramlen32 registered as FT_UINT32 with filter scsi.cdb.paramlen32.\n\n\\- Updated dissect_spc_persresvout() to use hf_scsi_paramlen32 for the 4-byte parameter length.\n\n\\- Verified with tools/check_typed_item_calls.py (0 warnings).",
  "state": "merged",
