      "title": "SCSI: Add 32-bit parameter length field for PERSISTENT RESERVE OUT",
      "message": "SCSI: Add 32-bit parameter length field for PERSISTENT RESERVE OUT\n\nIn PERSISTENT RESERVE OUT CDBs (SPC-4 section 6.14), the Parameter List Length field is 4 bytes. The dissector used hf_scsi_paramlen16 with a 4-byte length, causing a field type mismatch warning in the checker tool check_typed_item_calls.py.\n\nAdd hf_scsi_paramlen32 registered as FT_UINT32 and use it when dissecting the 4-byte parameter length in dissect_spc_persresvout().",
      "author_name": "meel-ayush",
      "author_email": "ayushmeel.dev@gmail.com",
